{
  "name": "Обработка лидов с AI-квалификацией (демо v3)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Обработка лидов (демо v3)\n\nВход — **Webhook** (POST /webhook/lead), нужен заголовок **x-webhook-secret**.\n\nДобавлено: проверка секрета, **дедуп** по e-mail, локальное хранилище лидов, **ответ клиенту**.\n\nLLM/CRM/Telegram — заглушки (без ключей).",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
      "name": "Пояснение",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        150,
        100
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "lead",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001",
      "name": "Приём заявки (webhook)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        440
      ],
      "webhookId": "60bd94eb-173b-413c-b2a0-5164e0c6655a"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const sd = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nsd.seen = sd.seen || [];\nconst it = items[0].json;\nconst h = it.headers || {};\nconst b = (it.body && typeof it.body === 'object') ? it.body : it;\nconst SECRET = 'demo-secret-123';\nconst authorized = h['x-webhook-secret'] === SECRET;\nconst name = String(b.name || '').trim();\nconst email = String(b.email || '').trim().toLowerCase();\nconst service = String(b.service || '').trim();\nconst budget = Number(b.budget || 0);\nconst message = String(b.message || '').trim();\nconst valid = name.length > 1 && /.+@.+\\..+/.test(email);\nlet lead = 'new';\nif (!valid) lead = 'invalid';\nelse if (sd.seen.includes(email)) lead = 'dup';\nreturn [{ json: { name, email, service, budget, message, authorized, lead } }];"
      },
      "id": "b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
      "name": "Секрет, нормализация, дедуп",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        460,
        440
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c-auth",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.authorized ? \"ok\" : \"no\" }}",
              "rightValue": "ok",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003",
      "name": "Секрет верный?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        700,
        440
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c-new",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.lead }}",
              "rightValue": "new",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004",
      "name": "Новый лид?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        940,
        440
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "return items.map((item) => {\n  const l = item.json;\n  const text = (l.service + ' ' + l.message).toLowerCase();\n  let score = 40;\n  if (l.budget >= 300000) score += 35; else if (l.budget >= 100000) score += 20; else score += 5;\n  if (/реклам|заявк|лид|конверс/.test(text)) score += 15;\n  if (/ai|ии|автоматизац|интеграц/.test(text)) score += 10;\n  score = Math.min(score, 99);\n  const category = score >= 70 ? 'горячий' : score >= 50 ? 'тёплый' : 'холодный';\n  const priority = score >= 70 ? 'высокий' : score >= 50 ? 'средний' : 'низкий';\n  const nextStep = score >= 70 ? 'звонок в течение 15 минут' : score >= 50 ? 'письмо с коммерческим предложением' : 'прогревающая рассылка';\n  return { json: { ...l, score, category, priority, nextStep } };\n});"
      },
      "id": "b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005",
      "name": "AI-квалификация лида (LLM-заглушка)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1180,
        380
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const sd = $getWorkflowStaticData('global');\nsd.seen = sd.seen || [];\nsd.leads = sd.leads || [];\nreturn items.map((it) => {\n  const l = it.json;\n  if (!sd.seen.includes(l.email)) sd.seen.push(l.email);\n  const rec = { crm_id: 'CRM-' + l.email.split('@')[1], name: l.name, email: l.email, score: l.score, category: l.category, stage: l.category, created_at: new Date().toISOString() };\n  sd.leads.push(rec);\n  return { json: { ...l, crm_id: rec.crm_id, stage: rec.stage, created_at: rec.created_at, stored_total: sd.leads.length } };\n});"
      },
      "id": "b0000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006",
      "name": "CRM: сохранить лид",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1420,
        380
      ]
    },
